\" d=\"M56 347Q56 360 70 367H707Q722 359 722 347Q722 336 708 328L390 327H72Q56 332 56 347ZM56 153Q56 168 72 173H708Q722 163 722 153Q722 140 707 133H70Q56 140 56 153Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E3-MJMAIN-2E\" d=\"M78 60Q78 84 95 102T138 120Q162 120 180 104T199 61Q199 36 182 18T139 0T96 17T78 60Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-7C\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-2212\" x=\"500\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-33\" x=\"1501\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-7C\" x=\"2001\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-3D\" x=\"2558\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-7C\" x=\"3614\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-33\" x=\"3893\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-7C\" x=\"4393\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-3D\" x=\"4949\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(6006,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-33\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-2E\" x=\"500\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</svg></span></p>\n<p>In general, for any real number <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"1.877ex\" height=\"2.009ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.671ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -576.1 808 865.1\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-4-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-4-Title\">a,</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E4-MJMATHI-61\" d=\"M33 157Q33 258 109 349T280 441Q331 441 370 392Q386 422 416 422Q429 422 439 414T449 394Q449 381 412 234T374 68Q374 43 381 35T402 26Q411 27 422 35Q443 55 463 131Q469 151 473 152Q475 153 483 153H487Q506 153 506 144Q506 138 501 117T481 63T449 13Q436 0 417 -8Q409 -10 393 -10Q359 -10 336 5T306 36L300 51Q299 52 296 50Q294 48 292 46Q233 -10 172 -10Q117 -10 75 30T33 157ZM35