114 325 217T351 328Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E5-MJMAIN-3D\" d=\"M56 347Q56 360 70 367H707Q722 359 722 347Q722 336 708 328L390 327H72Q56 332 56 347ZM56 153Q56 168 72 173H708Q722 163 722 153Q722 140 707 133H70Q56 140 56 153Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E5-MJMAIN-2E\" d=\"M78 60Q78 84 95 102T138 120Q162 120 180 104T199 61Q199 36 182 18T139 0T96 17T78 60Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-7C\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-2212\" x=\"500\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMATHI-61\" x=\"1501\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-7C\" x=\"2030\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-3D\" x=\"2587\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-7C\" x=\"3643\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMATHI-61\" x=\"3922\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-7C\" x=\"4451\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E5-MJMAIN-2E\" x=\"4730\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span></p>\n<p>We can use this fact to simplify expressions containing absolute value. Let's see an example.</p>\n\n        </div>",
